# Creature Server environment. This file is a conffile: package upgrades preserve local edits.
#
# Secrets belong HERE and not in the systemd unit. Unit files are world-readable
# under /lib/systemd/system, so an API key in ExecStart is readable by every user
# on the box. This file can be mode 0600, owned by whoever runs the server.
#
# Everything else lives in /etc/creature/server.json.

# ElevenLabs. Without it the server still runs and stage re-renders still work;
# only fresh dialog and voice generation need it.
#VOICE_API_KEY=

# Honeycomb. Without it the server runs with console-only logging and exports no
# traces, which is survivable but makes production problems much harder to see.
#HONEYCOMB_API_KEY=

# Any extra flags for one-off experiments, appended to ExecStart by the unit.
#CREATURE_SERVER_EXTRA_ARGS=
